        CommandIds.PromoteFolder => "Turn the selected browsed folder into a workspace in one step. Tern writes a small .tern-workspace.json descriptor into the folder and indexes it, so content search, backlinks, broken-link checks and tasks become available. No files are moved, renamed or changed, and open documents, history and recovery copies are kept. Delete the descriptor file to undo.",
