        CommandIds.OpenFile => "Choose Markdown files (.md, .markdown, .mdown) or text notes (.txt) from your computer and open each in a tab. Text notes remain editable and use the Markdown preview. The first successful open replaces the initial New document. If it contains edits, review Save, Don't save or Cancel first. A failed open keeps your note.",
        CommandIds.OpenWorkspace => "Open a saved named workspace root containing .tern-workspace.json, populate its tree and restore saved-document tabs, caret/scroll positions, active document and view mode recorded on a successful workspace close. Unsaved text stays in recovery, not workspace metadata. The file tree appears first; links and search are prepared in the background, so you can keep working or open another workspace. Open Folder only browses; legacy roots remain supported.",
