        CommandIds.Print => "Review actual PDF pages. Select All, Current page (the displayed page), or Pages such as 1-3, 5. Choose Print… to pick a Windows printer and copies. Open selected PDF… is another option if you prefer a PDF reader. Your Markdown is unchanged.",
        CommandIds.Settings => "Adjust theme, editor and preview fonts, reading width, reduced motion, word wrap, line numbers, current-line highlighting, tab size and spaces, synchronized scrolling, default view and Markdown profile. File preferences control session restore, external-change reload, final newline, trailing whitespace and external links. Apply commits pending changes; Done applies and closes; Cancel discards unapplied changes.",
